                    "text": "in 2 (signal/float) Cutoff in Hz @min samplerate/24576 @max samplerate/2.125"
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "code": "\r\nrequire(\"evi_biquad.genexpr\");\r\n\r\n/*\r\n    0   eviBiquadCoeffHighpass                  cutoff, Q\r\n    1   eviBiquadCoeffHighpassGain              cutoff, gain, Q   (default)\r\n    2   eviBiquadCoeffButterworthHighpass       cutoff\r\n    3   eviBiquadCoeffButterworthHighpassGain   cutoff, gain\r\n*/\r\nParam   filter(1, min=0, max=3);\r\nfilt    = int(filter);\r\nreset   = delta(change(filt)) < 0;\r\n\r\na0, a1, a2, b1, b2  = 0;\r\nif (filt == 1) {\r\n    a0, a1, a2, b1, b2  = eviBiquadCoeffHighpassGain(in2, dbtoa(in3), in4);\r\n}\r\nelse if (filt == 2) {\r\n    a0, a1, a2, b1, b2  = eviBiquadCoeffButterworthHighpass(in2);\r\n}\r\nelse if (filt == 3) {\r\n    a0, a1, a2, b1, b2  = eviBiquadCoeffButterworthHighpassGain(in2, dbtoa(in3));\r\n}\r\nelse {\r\n    a0, a1, a2, b1, b2  = eviBiquadCoeffHighpass(in2, in4);\r\n}\r\n\r\nout1    = biquadDf2reset(in1, a0, a1, a2, b1, b2, reset);\r\n\r\n",
                    "fontface": 0,
                    "fontname": "<Monospaced>",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
